Some few-shot examples may be useful:
Query:
-- 1. Distinct evaluation types available in the FIA “population_evaluation_type” table
SELECT DISTINCT `evaluation_type`
FROM   `bigquery-public-data.usfs_fia.population_evaluation_type`
ORDER  BY `evaluation_type`;
